    {
     "q": "Where does Vidhi Transport have branches?",
     "a": "Vidhi Transport lists 14 branch locations across Gujarat and Maharashtra, including Ahmedabad, Vadodara, Nandesari, Dahej, Ankleshwar, Panoli, Sachin, Vapi, Sarigam and Umergaon, Bhiwandi, Navi Mumbai, Rabale, Tarapur and Vasai."
