    {
     "q": "Can I contact a Vidhi Transport branch directly?",
     "a": "Yes. Each branch card provides a direct phone number and exact address. Contact the branch to confirm the actual pickup, delivery, route and cargo requirement."
    },
    {
     "q": "Does every service-area tag represent a physical office?",
     "a": "No. Service-area tags show nearby or connected localities coordinated by a branch. They do not claim a separate office or guaranteed pickup in every listed area."
    },
    {
     "q": "Are all services available at every branch?",
     "a": "Capabilities vary by branch, cargo, route, documents, timing and vehicle availability. Use the branch contact or quotation form to confirm the exact requirement."
